      "sections": [
        {
          "no": "01",
          "en": "SIGNATURE",
          "title": "三类事故，三套参数指纹",
          "html": "<p>井下事故的物理机制不同，参数响应也不同。<b>气侵</b>是地层流体进入井筒，池体积上涨、返出流量大于泵入流量、总烃升高；<b>井漏</b>是井筒液体漏进地层，池体积与返出流量同时下降、立压降低；<b>卡钻</b>是钻具被卡，扭矩与立压异常升高、返出流量下降。</p><div class=\"figure\"><svg viewBox=\"0 18 680 192\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"事故前兆的参数指纹\" style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI','Noto Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\"><text x=\"6\" y=\"12\" font-size=\"9.4\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\">同一套参数，不同事故有不同的「指纹」</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"8.6\" fill=\"#79828a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">立管压力</text><text x=\"276\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"8.6\" fill=\"#79828a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">返出流量</text><text x=\"372\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"8.6\" fill=\"#79828a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">池体积</text><text x=\"468\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"8.6\" fill=\"#79828a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">总烃</text><text x=\"564\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"8.6\" fill=\"#79828a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">扭矩</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"116\" height=\"44\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"54\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#242b2e\" font-weight=\"600\">气侵</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\">地层流体侵入</text><rect x=\"138\" y=\"34\" width=\"84\" height=\"44\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" opacity=\"0.07\"/><line x1=\"174\" y1=\"68\" x2=\"174\" y2=\"53\" stroke=\"#2f7d6b\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"174,50 171.4,55 176.6,55\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"7.6\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">先升后降</text><rect x=\"234\" y=\"34\" width=\"84\" height=\"44\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" opacity=\"0.07\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"68\" x2=\"270\" y2=\"53\" stroke=\"#2f7d6b\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"270,50 267.4,55 272.6,55\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\"/><text x=\"276\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"7.6\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">增大</text><rect x=\"330\" y=\"34\" width=\"84\" height=\"44\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" opacity=\"0.07\"/><line x1=\"366\" y1=\"68\" x2=\"366\" y2=\"53\" stroke=\"#2f7d6b\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"366,50 363.4,55 368.6,55\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"7.6\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">上涨</text><rect x=\"426\" y=\"34\" width=\"84\" height=\"44\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" opacity=\"0.07\"/><line x1=\"462\" y1=\"68\" x2=\"462\" y2=\"53\" stroke=\"#2f7d6b\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"462,50 459.4,55 464.6,55\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\"/><line x1=\"469\" y1=\"68\" x2=\"469\" y2=\"53\" stroke=\"#2f7d6b\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"469,50 466.4,55 471.6,55\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\"/><text x=\"468\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"7.6\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">先兆</text><rect x=\"522\" y=\"34\" width=\"84\" height=\"44\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\" opacity=\"0.03\"/><text x=\"564\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"7.6\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\" text-anchor=\"middle\"></text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"88\" width=\"116\" height=\"44\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#242b2e\" font-weight=\"600\">井漏</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\">井筒液柱漏失</text><rect x=\"138\" y=\"88\" width=\"84\" height=\"44\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#b26a39\" opacity=\"0.07\"/><line x1=\"174\" y1=\"98\" x2=\"174\" y2=\"113\" stroke=\"#b26a39\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"174,116 171.4,111 176.6,111\" fill=\"#b26a39\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"128\" font-size=\"7.6\" fill=\"#b26a39\" text-anchor=\"middle\">下降</text><rect x=\"234\" y=\"88\" width=\"84\" height=\"44\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#b26a39\" opacity=\"0.07\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"98\" x2=\"270\" y2=\"113\" stroke=\"#b26a39\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"270,116 267.4,111 272.6,111\" fill=\"#b26a39\"/><text x=\"276\" y=\"128\" font-size=\"7.6\" fill=\"#b26a39\" text-anchor=\"middle\">减小</text><rect x=\"330\" y=\"88\" width=\"84\" height=\"44\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#b26a39\" opacity=\"0.07\"/><line x1=\"366\" y1=\"98\" x2=\"366\" y2=\"113\" stroke=\"#b26a39\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"366,116 363.4,111 368.6,111\" fill=\"#b26a39\"/><line x1=\"373\" y1=\"98\" x2=\"373\" y2=\"113\" stroke=\"#b26a39\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"373,116 370.4,111 375.6,111\" fill=\"#b26a39\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"128\" font-size=\"7.6\" fill=\"#b26a39\" text-anchor=\"middle\">下降</text><rect x=\"426\" y=\"88\" width=\"84\" height=\"44\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\" opacity=\"0.03\"/><text x=\"468\" y=\"128\" font-size=\"7.6\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\" text-anchor=\"middle\"></text><rect x=\"522\" y=\"88\" width=\"84\" height=\"44\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\" opacity=\"0.03\"/><text x=\"564\" y=\"128\" font-size=\"7.6\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\" text-anchor=\"middle\"></text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"142\" width=\"116\" height=\"44\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"162\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#242b2e\" font-weight=\"600\">卡钻</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"178\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\">钻具被卡</text><rect x=\"138\" y=\"142\" width=\"84\" height=\"44\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" opacity=\"0.07\"/><line x1=\"174\" y1=\"176\" x2=\"174\" y2=\"161\" stroke=\"#2f7d6b\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"174,158 171.4,163 176.6,163\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"182\" font-size=\"7.6\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">上升</text><rect x=\"234\" y=\"142\" width=\"84\" height=\"44\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#b26a39\" opacity=\"0.07\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"152\" x2=\"270\" y2=\"167\" stroke=\"#b26a39\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"270,170 267.4,165 272.6,165\" fill=\"#b26a39\"/><text x=\"276\" y=\"182\" font-size=\"7.6\" fill=\"#b26a39\" text-anchor=\"middle\">减小</text><rect x=\"330\" y=\"142\" width=\"84\" height=\"44\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\" opacity=\"0.03\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"182\" font-size=\"7.6\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\" text-anchor=\"middle\"></text><rect x=\"426\" y=\"142\" width=\"84\" height=\"44\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\" opacity=\"0.03\"/><text x=\"468\" y=\"182\" font-size=\"7.6\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\" text-anchor=\"middle\"></text><rect x=\"522\" y=\"142\" width=\"84\" height=\"44\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" opacity=\"0.07\"/><line x1=\"558\" y1=\"176\" x2=\"558\" y2=\"161\" stroke=\"#2f7d6b\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"558,158 555.4,163 560.6,163\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\"/><line x1=\"565\" y1=\"176\" x2=\"565\" y2=\"161\" stroke=\"#2f7d6b\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"565,158 562.4,163 567.6,163\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\"/><text x=\"564\" y=\"182\" font-size=\"7.6\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">上升</text><text x=\"6\" y=\"202\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#79828a\">这些「指纹」是预警的物理基础：单看一条曲线分不清，合起来看才有意义。</text></svg></div><div class=\"figcap\"><b>图 1</b><span>三类事故在五个关键通道上的响应方向。这些差异正是多变量方法的价值所在——单看一条曲线分不清。</span></div><p>注意「气侵」的立压是<b>先升后降</b>：气体侵入初期液柱变轻、环空压力下降，但节流阀调整后立压又会回升。这种非单调响应是静态阈值最容易被骗的地方。</p>"
        },
        {
          "no": "02",
          "en": "WHY HARD",
          "title": "死阈值的两难",
          "html": "<p>把阈值设低，噪声尖峰会把报警打满；设高，等报警时事故已经发生。更麻烦的是，<b>正常工况本身就在大变</b>：接单根时立压会掉几个兆帕，起下钻时池体积会大幅变化。</p><div class=\"figure\"><svg viewBox=\"0 18 680 196\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"死阈值的两难\" style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI','Noto Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\"><text x=\"6\" y=\"16\" font-size=\"9.4\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\">死阈值的两难：设低了被噪声骗，设高了来不及</text><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"650\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#dcd6c6\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"50\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\" text-anchor=\"end\">池体积</text><path d=\"M30 113.4 L34 108.743 L38 109.214 L42 113.108 L46 114.269 L50 110.477 L54 106.494 L58 107.663 L62 112.694 L66 115.385 L70 112.95 L74 109.716 L78 111.198 L82 116.563 L86 119.664 L90 117.254 L94 113.3 L98 113.567 L102 117.803 L106 120.069 L110 116.777 L114 111.575 L118 110.485 L122 113.848 L126 115.95 L130 112.832 L134 107.723 L138 106.754 L142 110.741 L146 114.12 L150 112.475 L154 108.49 L158 108.289 L162 113.107 L166 117.549 L170 116.787 L174 112.99 L178 112.305 L182 116.478 L186 120.431 L190 119.076 L194 114.168 L198 111.939 L202 114.714 L206 117.824 L210 115.984 L214 110.514 L218 107.645 L222 110.199 L226 113.856 L230 113.058 L234 108.562 L238 106.442 L242 109.889 L246 114.873 L250 115.538 L254 112.043 L258 110.263 L262 113.766 L266 118.905 L270 119.657 L274 115.687 L278 112.745 L282 114.873 L286 118.94 L290 118.891 L294 113.967 L298 109.794 L302 110.866 L306 114.566 L310 114.787 L314 110.272 L318 106.38 L322 107.91 L326 112.656 L330 114.394 L334 111.277 L338 108.286 L342 110.446 L346 115.963 L350 118.559 L354 115.857 L358 112.507 L362 113.824 L366 118.552 L370 120.518 L374 116.953 L378 112.238 L382 112.024 L386 115.654 L390 117.128 L394 113.285 L398 108.169 L402 107.652 L406 111.589 L410 114.077 L414 111.474 L418 107.126 L422 107.173 L426 111.917 L430 115.536 L434 113.899 L438 110.063 L442 110.05 L446 114.63 L450 118.193 L454 116.259 L458 111.476 L462 110.015 L466 113.238 L470 115.879 L474 113.202 L478 107.464 L482 104.949 L486 107.568 L490 110.373 L494 108.323 L498 103.164 L502 101.126 L506 104.543 L510 108.711 L514 108.218 L518 104.216 L522 102.799 L526 106.699 L530 111.503 L534 111.528 L538 107.401 L542 105.143 L546 107.972 L550 111.926 L554 111.194 L558 105.98 L562 102.261 L566 103.775 L570 107.049 L574 106.174 L578 100.878 L582 96.9792 L586 98.6109 L590 102.702 L594 103.167 L598 99.144 L602 96.1514 L606 98.6045 L610 103.8 L614 105.493 L618 102.248 L622 99.2831 L626 101.337 L630 106.186 L634 107.579 L638 103.634 L642 99.3512 L646 99.8648 L650 103.534\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4d565b\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"106.8\" x2=\"650\" y2=\"106.8\" stroke=\"#b05a51\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/><text x=\"38\" y=\"120.8\" font-size=\"8.2\" fill=\"#b05a51\">阈值低：提前 40 min 就报，但 4 次里有 3 次是噪声</text><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"93.6\" x2=\"650\" y2=\"93.6\" stroke=\"#b26a39\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/><text x=\"38\" y=\"86.6\" font-size=\"8.2\" fill=\"#b26a39\">阈值高：报警时事故已经发生</text><line x1=\"414.4\" y1=\"44\" x2=\"414.4\" y2=\"124\" stroke=\"#2f7d6b\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><text x=\"418.4\" y=\"42\" font-size=\"8.2\" fill=\"#235f51\">事故真实发生</text><text x=\"6\" y=\"200\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#79828a\">静态阈值的根本问题：它把「偏离多少」当成唯一信息，忽略了曲线的形状与通道之间的相关性。</text></svg></div><div class=\"figcap\"><b>图 2</b><span>同一条池体积曲线上的两条阈值：低阈值提前 40 分钟报警但全是误报，高阈值报警时已经晚了。</span></div><p>这就是为什么工业界不用「绝对阈值 + 单通道」，而是用<b>相对基线 + 多通道 + 持续时间</b>：只有当多个通道同时偏离、并且持续若干分钟，才算一次可信的预警。</p>"
        },
        {
          "no": "03",
          "en": "METHODS",
          "title": "三代方法：阈值、残差、多变量",
          "html": "<p>第一代是静态阈值，实现简单、误报高；第二代引入<b>基线残差</b>（EWMA 估计正常水平，用 z 值衡量偏离），解决了「正常工况在变」的问题，但仍是单通道；第三代把多通道残差合成为一个分数，并要求连续超限，误报显著下降。</p><div class=\"figure\"><svg viewBox=\"0 18 680 218\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"三种预警策略\" style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI','Noto Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"6\" width=\"668\" height=\"64\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"6\" y=\"6\" width=\"3\" height=\"64\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#b05a51\"/><text x=\"18\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#242b2e\" font-weight=\"600\">A. 静态阈值</text><text x=\"18\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"8.4\" fill=\"#79828a\">只看绝对量，误报多</text><line x1=\"300\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"600\" y2=\"50\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M300 46 L305 43.0644 L310 43.615 L315 46.1594 L320 46.521 L325 44.0288 L330 42.5228 L335 44.6982 L340 48.0802 L345 48.5368 L350 46.2025 L355 45.1543 L360 47.3353 L365 49.6434 L370 48.4616 L375 44.9938 L380 43.5844 L385 45.4701 L390 47.0987 L395 45.4578 L400 42.5869 L405 42.6471 L410 45.832 L415 48.0398 L420 46.7931 L425 44.7491 L430 45.6754 L435 48.8085 L440 49.8787 L445 47.3144 L450 44.5454 L455 45.0296 L460 47.2818 L465 47.172 L470 44.107 L475 42.0184 L480 43.6911 L485 46.7268 L490 46.7825 L495 44.2173 L500 43.1594 L505 45.4978 L510 48.0508 L515 47.1116 L520 43.7965 L525 42.3733 L530 44.0248 L535 45.1815 L540 42.8552 L545 39.144 L550 38.2882 L555 40.5702 L560 41.9769 L565 40.1076 L570 37.6677 L575 38.4333 L580 41.6103 L585 42.869 L590 40.5587 L595 38.0185 L600 38.6154\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#b05a51\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"354\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"354\" y2=\"50\" stroke=\"#b05a51\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.6\"/><line x1=\"399\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"399\" y2=\"50\" stroke=\"#b05a51\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.6\"/><line x1=\"441\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"441\" y2=\"50\" stroke=\"#b05a51\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.6\"/><line x1=\"516\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"516\" y2=\"50\" stroke=\"#b05a51\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.6\"/><text x=\"606\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#b05a51\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace\">报警 4 次</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"80\" width=\"668\" height=\"64\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"6\" y=\"80\" width=\"3\" height=\"64\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#b26a39\"/><text x=\"18\" y=\"98\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#242b2e\" font-weight=\"600\">B. 基线残差（EWMA + z 值）</text><text x=\"18\" y=\"114\" font-size=\"8.4\" fill=\"#79828a\">看「相对正常工况偏了多少」，仍单通道</text><line x1=\"300\" y1=\"124\" x2=\"600\" y2=\"124\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M300 120 L305 117.064 L310 117.615 L315 120.159 L320 120.521 L325 118.029 L330 116.523 L335 118.698 L340 122.08 L345 122.537 L350 120.202 L355 119.154 L360 121.335 L365 123.643 L370 122.462 L375 118.994 L380 117.584 L385 119.47 L390 121.099 L395 119.458 L400 116.587 L405 116.647 L410 119.832 L415 122.04 L420 120.793 L425 118.749 L430 119.675 L435 122.809 L440 123.879 L445 121.314 L450 118.545 L455 119.03 L460 121.282 L465 121.172 L470 118.107 L475 116.018 L480 117.691 L485 120.727 L490 120.516 L495 117.617 L500 116.226 L505 118.231 L510 120.451 L515 119.178 L520 115.53 L525 113.773 L530 115.091 L535 115.915 L540 113.255 L545 109.211 L550 108.022 L555 109.97 L560 111.044 L565 108.841 L570 106.068 L575 106.5 L580 109.344 L585 110.269 L590 107.625 L595 104.752 L600 105.015\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#b26a39\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"390\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"124\" stroke=\"#b26a39\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.6\"/><line x1=\"516\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"516\" y2=\"124\" stroke=\"#b26a39\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.6\"/><text x=\"606\" y=\"98\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#b26a39\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace\">报警 2 次</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"154\" width=\"668\" height=\"64\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"6\" y=\"154\" width=\"3\" height=\"64\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\"/><text x=\"18\" y=\"172\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#242b2e\" font-weight=\"600\">C. 多变量 + 持续时间</text><text x=\"18\" y=\"188\" font-size=\"8.4\" fill=\"#79828a\">多通道合看，并要求连续超限才报警</text><line x1=\"300\" y1=\"198\" x2=\"600\" y2=\"198\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M300 194 L305 191.064 L310 191.615 L315 194.159 L320 194.521 L325 192.029 L330 190.523 L335 192.698 L340 196.08 L345 196.537 L350 194.202 L355 193.154 L360 195.335 L365 197.643 L370 196.462 L375 192.994 L380 191.584 L385 193.47 L390 195.099 L395 193.458 L400 190.587 L405 190.647 L410 193.832 L415 196.04 L420 194.793 L425 192.749 L430 193.675 L435 196.809 L440 197.879 L445 195.314 L450 192.545 L455 193.03 L460 195.282 L465 195.172 L470 192.107 L475 190.018 L480 191.691 L485 194.727 L490 194.249 L495 191.017 L500 189.293 L505 190.964 L510 192.851 L515 191.245 L520 187.263 L525 185.173 L530 186.158 L535 186.648 L540 183.655 L545 179.277 L550 177.755 L555 179.37 L560 180.11 L565 177.574 L570 174.468 L575 174.567 L580 177.077 L585 177.669 L590 174.692 L595 171.485 L600 171.415\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2f7d6b\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"498\" y1=\"164\" x2=\"498\" y2=\"198\" stroke=\"#2f7d6b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.6\"/><text x=\"606\" y=\"172\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace\">报警 1 次</text></svg></div><div class=\"figcap\"><b>图 3</b><span>三种策略在同一段数据上的报警次数：阈值 4 次、残差 2 次、多变量 1 次，而真实事故只有 1 次。</span></div><p>再往上就是学习型方法（AutoEncoder、LSTM 预测残差、图神经网络建模通道关系）。它们能捕捉更复杂的模式，但在事故样本极少的情况下，<b>可解释性</b>往往比精度更重要——司钻需要知道「为什么报警」。</p>"
        },
        {
          "no": "04",
          "en": "EVALUATION",
          "title": "评价：提前量是一条曲线",
          "html": "<p>预警系统不能用单一指标评价。核心是<b>提前量—误报率曲线</b>：想提前 30 分钟，就必然要多报几次；想每班只报一次，提前量就得缩到 5—10 分钟。工程上先定「每班能承受几次报警」，再在这条曲线上选工作点。</p><div class=\"figure\"><svg viewBox=\"0 18 680 188\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"预警的工程约束\" style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI','Noto Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\"><text x=\"6\" y=\"16\" font-size=\"9.2\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\">A · 提前量与误报率的取舍</text><line x1=\"56\" y1=\"168\" x2=\"316\" y2=\"168\" stroke=\"#dcd6c6\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"56\" y1=\"168\" x2=\"56\" y2=\"48\" stroke=\"#dcd6c6\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M77.44 57.6 L91.6 72 L110.48 93.6 L134.08 115.2 L162.4 132 L197.8 146.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2f7d6b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"77.44\" cy=\"57.6\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\"/><circle cx=\"91.6\" cy=\"72\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\"/><circle cx=\"110.48\" cy=\"93.6\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\"/><circle cx=\"134.08\" cy=\"115.2\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\"/><circle cx=\"162.4\" cy=\"132\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\"/><circle cx=\"197.8\" cy=\"146.4\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\"/><circle cx=\"110.48\" cy=\"93.6\" r=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#b26a39\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"106.48\" y=\"81.6\" font-size=\"8.2\" fill=\"#8e5229\">工况可接受点</text><text x=\"312\" y=\"182\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\" text-anchor=\"end\">提前量 →</text><text x=\"52\" y=\"52\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\" text-anchor=\"end\">误报率</text><text x=\"360\" y=\"16\" font-size=\"9.2\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\">B · 每班能承受几次报警</text><text x=\"360\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#4d565b\">每班 1 次</text><rect x=\"440\" y=\"39\" width=\"190\" height=\"10\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#efece1\"/><rect x=\"440\" y=\"39\" width=\"142.5\" height=\"10\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\"/><text x=\"636\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"8.4\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\" text-anchor=\"end\">现场可接受</text><text x=\"360\" y=\"94\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#4d565b\">每班 5 次</text><rect x=\"440\" y=\"85\" width=\"190\" height=\"10\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#efece1\"/><rect x=\"440\" y=\"85\" width=\"79.8\" height=\"10\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#b26a39\"/><text x=\"636\" y=\"94\" font-size=\"8.4\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\" text-anchor=\"end\">开始被忽略</text><text x=\"360\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#4d565b\">每班 20 次</text><rect x=\"440\" y=\"131\" width=\"190\" height=\"10\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#efece1\"/><rect x=\"440\" y=\"131\" width=\"22.8\" height=\"10\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#b05a51\"/><text x=\"636\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"8.4\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\" text-anchor=\"end\">等于没有报警</text><text x=\"360\" y=\"192\" font-size=\"8.6\" fill=\"#79828a\">报警疲劳是真实的工程约束：误报太多，司钻就会把报警关掉。</text></svg></div><div class=\"figcap\"><b>图 4</b><span>左：提前量与误报率的取舍。右：不同报警频次下现场的真实反应——报警太多等于没有报警。</span></div><p>另一个必须报的指标是<b>漏报</b>：任何一次真实的卡钻/井漏都不能被漏掉。所以在曲线上选点时，漏报率是硬约束，误报率是可以谈的成本。</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    "workflow": {
      "label": "案例流程",
      "title": "从多通道曲线到一条可解释的预警",
      "lead": [
        "示范页把三类事故放在同一套通道上，用**滚动基线 + 残差 z 值 + 持续时间**打分，拖动灵敏度就能看到「提前量」与「误报」如何互换。",
        "注意第一步不是建模，而是**定义正常**——工况识别做不好，后面全是误报。"
      ],
      "stats": [
        [
          "区块",
          "2 个区块，18 个月"
        ],
        [
          "通道",
          "12 个，1 s 采样"
        ],
        [
          "事故",
          "47 起（气侵 21 / 井漏 15 / 卡钻 11）"
        ],
        [
          "采样",
          "1 s → 1 min 聚合"
        ]
      ],
      "figure": {
        "title": "五步数据流：先定义正常，再谈异常",
        "lead": "工况识别是很多方案漏掉的一步：接单根时立压本来就会掉，把它算成异常就是纯误报。",
        "html": "<svg viewBox=\"0 18 680 182\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"预警数据流\" style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI','Noto Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"8\" width=\"118\" height=\"72\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"6\" y=\"8\" width=\"3\" height=\"72\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\"/><text x=\"18\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"10.2\" fill=\"#242b2e\" font-weight=\"600\">多通道时序</text><text x=\"18\" y=\"44\" font-size=\"8.6\" fill=\"#79828a\">10+ 通道，1 s 采样</text><text x=\"77\" y=\"71\" font-size=\"8.2\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace\">82 GB</text><line x1=\"126\" y1=\"44\" x2=\"134.4\" y2=\"44\" stroke=\"#9ba3a9\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"138,44 134,46.2 134,41.8\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\"/><rect x=\"140\" y=\"8\" width=\"118\" height=\"72\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"140\" y=\"8\" width=\"3\" height=\"72\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\"/><text x=\"152\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"10.2\" fill=\"#242b2e\" font-weight=\"600\">工况识别</text><text x=\"152\" y=\"44\" font-size=\"8.6\" fill=\"#79828a\">钻进 / 接单根 / 起下钻</text><text x=\"211\" y=\"71\" font-size=\"8.2\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace\">6 类</text><line x1=\"260\" y1=\"44\" x2=\"268.4\" y2=\"44\" stroke=\"#9ba3a9\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"272,44 268,46.2 268,41.8\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\"/><rect x=\"274\" y=\"8\" width=\"118\" height=\"72\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"274\" y=\"8\" width=\"3\" height=\"72\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\"/><text x=\"286\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"10.2\" fill=\"#242b2e\" font-weight=\"600\">基线模型</text><text x=\"286\" y=\"44\" font-size=\"8.6\" fill=\"#79828a\">EWMA + 残差 z 值</text><text x=\"345\" y=\"71\" font-size=\"8.2\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace\">每通道 1 条</text><line x1=\"394\" y1=\"44\" x2=\"402.4\" y2=\"44\" stroke=\"#9ba3a9\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"406,44 402,46.2 402,41.8\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\"/><rect x=\"408\" y=\"8\" width=\"118\" height=\"72\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"408\" y=\"8\" width=\"3\" height=\"72\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\"/><text x=\"420\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"10.2\" fill=\"#242b2e\" font-weight=\"600\">异常打分</text><text x=\"420\" y=\"44\" font-size=\"8.6\" fill=\"#79828a\">多变量 + 持续时间</text><text x=\"479\" y=\"71\" font-size=\"8.2\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace\">score 0—10</text><line x1=\"528\" y1=\"44\" x2=\"536.4\" y2=\"44\" stroke=\"#9ba3a9\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"540,44 536,46.2 536,41.8\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\"/><rect x=\"542\" y=\"8\" width=\"118\" height=\"72\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"542\" y=\"8\" width=\"3\" height=\"72\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#41699b\"/><text x=\"554\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"10.2\" fill=\"#242b2e\" font-weight=\"600\">分级预警</text><text x=\"554\" y=\"44\" font-size=\"8.6\" fill=\"#79828a\">提示 / 预警 / 报警</text><text x=\"613\" y=\"71\" font-size=\"8.2\" fill=\"#41699b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace\">带解释</text><text x=\"6\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"9.2\" fill=\"#79828a\">第二步「工况识别」是很多方案漏掉的：接单根时立压本来就会掉，把它算成异常就是纯误报。</text><text x=\"6\" y=\"118\" font-size=\"9.2\" fill=\"#b05a51\">所以预警系统的第一件事不是建模，而是把「正常」定义清楚。</text><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"128\" x2=\"674\" y2=\"128\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"6\" y=\"148\" font-size=\"8.6\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace\" letter-spacing=\".08em\">本案例示范</text><rect x=\"78\" y=\"137\" width=\"128.84\" height=\"17\" rx=\"8.5\" fill=\"#e6f1ec\"/><text x=\"142.42\" y=\"148.74\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#235f51\" text-anchor=\"middle\">三种事故场景 → 残差打分 → 提前量与误报</text><text x=\"340\" y=\"148\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\">打分与报警均为浏览器内真实计算。</text><text x=\"6\" y=\"172\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#b26a39\">验收看的是「提前量 15 min 时，每班还允许几次误报」——这是一条曲线，不是一个数。</text></svg>",
        "caption": "红色为模型部分，蓝色为交付部分；分级预警必须带解释，否则司钻不会信。"
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "name": "多通道对齐与清洗",
          "role": "数据",
          "do": "统一时标到 1 s，剔除传感器掉线与卡值；对流量、池体积做温漂与船摇补偿（海上钻井必需）。",
          "effect": "18 个月数据，有效率 97.3%；掉线段标记为缺失而不是插值。",
          "trap": "对缺失段直接线性插值。插值出来的「平稳」会被当成正常工况，真正的异常反而被抹掉。"
        },
        {
          "name": "工况识别",
          "role": "特征",
          "do": "用立压、转速、大钩负荷、泵冲的规则 + 轻量分类器划分钻进、接单根、起下钻、循环、静止五类工况。",
          "effect": "工况识别准确率 96%，为每条通道建立**分工况**的基线。",
          "trap": "不分工况建一个全局基线。接单根时的立压下降会被稳定地判成异常，每 30 分钟误报一次。"
        },
        {
          "name": "滚动基线残差",
          "role": "模型",
          "do": "对每个通道用 EWMA（半衰期 15 min）估计基线，用滚动标准差归一化得到 z 值；对非单调通道（立压）同时看一阶差分。",
          "effect": "把「绝对量」变成「相对正常工况偏了几个标准差」，量纲统一，可跨通道比较。",
          "trap": "用全段均值当基线。事故段会污染均值，导致基线本身被拉偏，越到后面越不灵敏。"
        },
        {
          "name": "多变量打分与持续判定",
          "role": "推断",
          "do": "取各通道 |z| 的加权最大值作为分数，权重按事故类型先验设定；要求连续 3 个采样点超限才报警，并对「哪条通道贡献最大」给出解释。",
          "effect": "误报从每班 6.2 次降到 0.9 次，提前量中位数 14 min。",
          "trap": "只取所有通道的简单平均。单通道的关键异常会被其他正常通道稀释掉——平均值最不敏感。"
        },
        {
          "name": "分级预警与闭环",
          "role": "交付",
          "do": "按分数分三级：提示（看趋势）、预警（准备措施）、报警（立即处置）；记录每次报警的处置结果，回灌调整权重。",
          "effect": "现场采纳率从 41% 提升到 78%，误报的处置记录成为下一轮训练数据。",
          "trap": "只报不记。没有处置反馈，权重永远调不准，系统会一直停在「狼来了」的状态。"
        }
      ],
